<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-jinshu" book-id="b-jinshu-056" chapter-id="c-jinshu-056-sun-tong" source-id="s-jinshu-056-sun-tong-ws1557685">
  <p id="c-jinshu-056-sun-tong:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-056-sun-tong:p001:m0000" ref="jt6_wrb_iv0">統</persName>字<persName id="c-jinshu-056-sun-tong:p001:m0002" ref="jt6_wrb_iv0">承公</persName>。幼與<persName id="c-jinshu-056-sun-tong:p001:m0007" ref="9c1_b3c_cb7">綽</persName>及從弟<persName id="c-jinshu-056-sun-tong:p001:m0011" ref="e74_385_649">盛</persName>過江。誕任不羈，而善屬文，時人以為有<persName id="c-jinshu-056-sun-tong:p001:m0030" ref="787_aa0_796">楚</persName>風。征北將軍<persName id="c-jinshu-056-sun-tong:p001:m0037" ref="xke_dj3_6ba_AA">褚裒</persName>聞其名，命為參軍，辭不就，家於會稽。性好山水，乃求為鄞令，轉在吳寧。居職不留心碎務，縱意遊肆，名山勝川，靡不窮究。後為余姚令，卒。子<persName id="c-jinshu-056-sun-tong:p001:m0105" ref="22x_o5h_te6">騰</persName>嗣，以博學著稱，位至廷尉。<persName id="c-jinshu-056-sun-tong:p001:m0119" ref="22x_o5h_te6">騰</persName>弟<persName id="c-jinshu-056-sun-tong:p001:m0121" ref="u7d_vw0_7kz">登</persName>，少善名理，注《老子》，行於世，仕至尚書郎，早終。</p>
</text>
